CONCLUSION: THE ULTIMATE ARCHITECTURE\uc0\u8232 Axion Phantom-Stratum v.1.0.0-ULTIMATE is the definitive solution for high-performance computing. It combines the raw, unbridled power of silicon-level isolation with the intelligence of a self-healing, telemetry-aware management engine. By mitigating thermal risks, ensuring systemic liveness, and abstracting high-end hardware features, APS v.1.0.0-ULTIMATE provides an unbreakable foundation for High-Frequency Trading, Real-Time Signal Processing, and Mission-Critical AI. It is the end of the "fragile" era and the beginning of Universal Silicon Sovereignty.\
